## CQ-TTP-01
@group client, creative
@commands TT-39: GUI scale 4 or a small window; hover a Logistics Module or a shulker box full of named items; then `[tooltips] keepTopOnScreen = false` in `creativeengineering-common.toml` and hover again; set it back
@pass Name at the top of the screen, the end cut off at the bottom; with the key off the name is cut off (vanilla); a short tooltip near the bottom still moves up
@fails `grep -i "ScreenTooltipTopMixin" logs/latest.log` (mixin apply error: the local slot 9 changed); a frame drawn by Iceberg's `Tooltips.calculateRect` needs brief step 2
@draft no batch holds this row yet
## CQ-TTP-02
@group same
@commands TT-40: hover a Stepstool, a Simple Hats mask, the Falconry Glove, a Sophisticated Backpack, a Lightman's wallet, stone
@pass Each curio item shows one gold "Slot: ..." line under the name; stepstool has no "Worn in the Feet slot"; stone none
@fails A doubled line means a mod's own line does not use the `curios.slot` key: note the item for `CuriosSlotTooltip`
@draft no batch holds this row yet
## CQ-TTP-03
@group same
@commands TT-41: hover Air Canister, Pressure Gauge Module, Glycerol without Shift, then with Shift
@pass Without Shift: the description in plain gray, wrapped, no "Hold Shift" line, no blue/aqua; Glycerol "Tastes sweet!"; with Shift: PNC's aqua text
@fails `grep -n "pnc_tooltips" logs/kubejs/startup.log` (a Rhino error naming `getTranslationKey`, `I18n.get` or `splitString`)
@draft no batch holds this row yet
